        "Content": "Clarlougheske, Donegal Town, F94 X5X8\n\n\n2 B/r Cottage on 9.46 Acres\n\nJust 40 metres off Donegal Town / Letterkenny N56 Roadway\n\n\nSituate just 40 metres off the Donegal Town / Letterkenny N56 Roadway and 3.5 km north east of Donegal Town. Great opportunity to acquire such a holding with such close proximity to the N56; Potential to develop.\n\nComprised in Folio DL 5476 and extending to 3.83 hectares (9.46 acres)\n\nCottage.Constructed in 1897 and extending to 91.63 sq.m.(986 sq.ft.)\nSitting Room, Kitchen with Living Area, Utility, 2 No. Bedrooms (1 en-suite) & Bathroom. Range of Out-Offices to rear\n\nLands.Situate to the rear and of reasonable grazing quality.\n\n\nHallway2.59 m. x 1.30 m.\ncarpet; built-in closet\n\nSitting Room3.94 m. x 3.42 m.\ncarpet; open fireplace\n\n \n\nLiving Room3.44 m. x 3.31 m.\nlino floor, built-in display unit, hotpress; archway opening to -\n\n \n\nKitchen4.37 m. x 3.97 m.\nfitted oak units, lino floor, pine ceiling\n\n \n \n\n\nBedroom No. 14.04 m. x 2.78 m.\n\nBedroom No. 23.27 m. x 2.68 m.\n\nEn-suiteElectric shower, toilet and wash basin\n\nStorage Room\n\nBathroom1.99 m. x 1.84 m.\nBath, toilet and wash basin; fully tiled\n\n\nBER - EBer. No.- 119819407\n\nPVC Double Glazed Windows\n\nOil fired central heating\n\nWheelchair friendly ramp access to front door\n\n\nTo the rear are various out-offices including -\n\nGarage5.72 m. x 3.34 m.\n\nLean To6.70 m. x 3.41 m.\n\nStorage Shed7.51 m. x 4.03 m.\n\nStorage Shed8.94 m. x 4.16 m. \n\n"
